<title>USA: Utah Cty $107 mln hospital bonds repriced, yld cut.</title>
<headline>Utah Cty $107 mln hospital bonds repriced, yld cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said Thursday it repriced Utah County's $107 million hospital bond deal, lowering the yield in 2026 to 5.74 percent from 5.75 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>UTAH COUNTY, UTAH</p>
<p>RE: $107,135,000*</p>
<p>HOSPITAL REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>(IHC HEALTH SERVICES, INC.)</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD AT THE INDICATED LEVELS.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa - MBIA	S&amp;P: AAA - MBIA</p>
<p>    DATED: 06/15/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 02/15/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 08/15</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>08/15/2021	     24,000M    5.25  %	  5.70</p>
<p>					  (Approx. $ Price 94.146)</p>
<p>08/15/2026	     83,135M    5.25  %	  5.74</p>
<p>					  (Approx. $ Price 93.11 )</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 08/15/2007    101.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 08/15/2008</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, June 27, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on July 29, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC. Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
